WEBVTT

00:03:28.363 --> 00:03:31.897
Most things in the real world
are non-fungible,

00:03:31.897 --> 00:03:35.730
because most physical objects are unique

00:03:35.763 --> 00:03:38.063
and can't be traded one for one.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:45.097
There is no painting, pet or person
that is exactly equivalent to another.

00:03:46.697 --> 00:03:48.197
Money, on the other hand,

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:51.797
is one of the few items that is fungible,

00:03:51.797 --> 00:03:55.130
meaning one dollar is equivalent
to another dollar

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.463
and one Bitcoin is equivalent
to another Bitcoin.

00:03:58.763 --> 00:04:00.997
The underlying decentralized technology